{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 15, :comments ["<b>Thus</b> — Bethel, where the calf is, is thus the worst evil of all their evil, for most of the kings of Israel did not turn away from the sin of Jeroboam." "And the meaning of <b>at dawn</b> — that they will be laid waste at night, and at dawn their king will be cut off."], :book :hosea, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 10, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Hosea -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/daat/olam_hatanah/mefaresh.asp?book=15&perek=1&mefaresh=ezra"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:50:51.464163300Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}